he'll just hand over 15 million?

566
00:38:07,080 --> 00:38:08,400
I said I'll talk to him for you.

567
00:38:08,400 --> 00:38:09,800
Are you not listening?

568
00:38:10,400 --> 00:38:11,640
Now get out.

569
00:38:12,400 --> 00:38:13,240
No...

570
00:38:13,280 --> 00:38:15,200
Are you leaving or not?

571
00:38:17,880 --> 00:38:19,440
Fine, I'm leaving.

572
00:38:25,400 --> 00:38:27,720
That jerk is nothing but trouble.

573
00:38:33,960 --> 00:38:34,760
P'Pite,

574
00:38:34,760 --> 00:38:36,520
are you alright?

575
00:38:38,640 --> 00:38:40,560
Oh, it's nothing.

576
00:38:41,240 --> 00:38:42,920
I bet you're hungry.

577
00:38:42,960 --> 00:38:44,320
Let me treat you to a meal.

578
00:38:44,720 --> 00:38:45,560
What?

579
00:38:46,320 --> 00:38:47,080
Let's go.

580
00:39:01,640 --> 00:39:03,360
Okay, I'm heading out.

581
00:39:04,120 --> 00:39:05,040
Thank you, P'Khun.

582
00:39:21,040 --> 00:39:21,920
Who was that?

583
00:39:28,000 --> 00:39:29,200
He's my coach.

584
00:39:29,240 --> 00:39:29,800
[Khongsittha Muay Thai]

585
00:39:38,600 --> 00:39:39,480
Your coach?

586
00:39:41,920 --> 00:39:43,040
He looks the part,

587
00:39:43,040 --> 00:39:45,240
but he seems a bit old with all that gray hair.

588
00:39:46,440 --> 00:39:47,640
Does he train you?

589
00:39:48,880 --> 00:39:49,600
Yes.

590
00:39:49,760 --> 00:39:51,280
He was training me while I was waiting for you.

591
00:39:56,080 --> 00:39:57,360
Talking like that...

592
00:39:57,840 --> 00:39:59,160
Now that's more like it.

593
00:40:02,840 --> 00:40:03,440
Look at you.

594
00:40:03,800 --> 00:40:06,320
You're all sweaty. Go take a shower.

595
00:40:16,880 --> 00:40:18,080
Let's go shower together.

596
00:40:18,920 --> 00:40:20,200
Don't drop the soap...

597
00:40:40,720 --> 00:40:41,480
Hey, Yok.

598
00:40:41,560 --> 00:40:42,200
Look.

599
00:40:44,120 --> 00:40:45,120
You want to do it here?

600
00:40:46,280 --> 00:40:47,240
Can't I?

601
00:40:48,120 --> 00:40:48,880
You can.

602
00:40:49,720 --> 00:40:51,400
Just make it quick, then.

603
00:41:04,160 --> 00:41:05,160
Someone's coming.

604
00:41:12,440 --> 00:41:14,160
Now we can go all out.

605
00:41:14,360 --> 00:41:15,880
All out, huh?

606
00:41:28,880 --> 00:41:29,960
Tomorrow's a day off.

607
00:41:29,960 --> 00:41:31,560
You have to keep me company.

608
00:41:31,560 --> 00:41:32,720
Hello, Mom.

609
00:41:32,720 --> 00:41:34,520
I have something to take care of at the college.

610
00:41:34,520 --> 00:41:36,680
I won't be able to come home for a few days.

611
00:41:36,680 --> 00:41:38,640
Usually, Ing doesn't take anyone under his wing.

612
00:41:38,640 --> 00:41:40,120
That means you must be pretty special.

613
00:41:41,040 --> 00:41:42,000
Don't tell your friends about us again.

614
00:41:42,720 --> 00:41:43,760
You're acting all disgusted.

615
00:41:44,000 --> 00:41:45,240
Do I look that disgusting?

616
00:41:45,920 --> 00:41:46,440
P'Ing,

617
00:41:48,040 --> 00:41:48,960
do we have to talk about it now?

618
00:41:49,280 --> 00:41:50,240
Someone might see us.

619
00:41:50,480 --> 00:41:51,920
I'm a straightforward guy.

620
00:41:52,240 --> 00:41:52,880
And let me tell you this,

621
00:41:53,080 --> 00:41:54,920
it won't be long before I make you
